<section class="auth oobe"><p class="eyebrow">FIRST RUN / OOBE</p><h1>创建超级管理员</h1><p class="lede">此账号是全站唯一的超级管理员，始终拥有全部权限。创建后无法通过注册流程增加第二个超级管理员。</p><% if (error) { %><p class="error"><%= error %></p><% } %><form method="post" action="/oobe"><label>用户名<input name="username" required minlength="3" autocomplete="username" placeholder="站点管理员"></label><label>邮箱<input name="email" required type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="admin@example.com"></label><label>密码<input name="password" required minlength="8" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="至少 8 位"></label><label>确认密码<input name="password_confirmation" required minlength="8" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="再次输入密码"></label><button class="button" type="submit">完成初始化</button></form></section>